s/ci/EXPORT_FIX_ACTIONS_ENTRY.md)\n\n기대: syntax32/32·unit58 OK·양 엔진 guard/contract 전체 및 DNS rc0, CI_RESULT PASS/rc0, Job/Check success, 원본 artifact/manifest·새 Runner ID/name 정리 인수.\nRunner v1.3/Admin1.1.1/Input Guard1.0 payload bytes를 유지합니다. 현재 PREPARED/image를 현장에서 확인하고 새 Run/Attempt/Job에 고정된 시작 키트로 한 세션만 실행합니다.\n\n과거 정상/negative의 인수 성적과 로컬58 결과를 이번 실제 CI에 승계하지 않습니다. count 결함 재시험은 이번 정상 인수 이후 범위를 결정합니다.\nPR17/PR19/main, 일반 Workflow 활성화/변수, 운영 Apply·엔진 전환은 변경하지 않습니다.\n독립 승인·병합·Issue5 최종 AC 종결과 이번 격리 시험 착수를 구분합니다.","created_at":"2026-09-17T07:41:55Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T08:46:23Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c1bad37e7fe8fafb9297f1fc1bbc015e4de7caa9","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/321Team/infra-ansible/pulls/22/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/321Team/infra-ansible/pulls/22/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/321Team/infra-ansible/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/321Team/infra-ansible/issues/22/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/321Team/infra-ansible/statuses/31895081e30e27481e7c17407047c9454e3b247a","head":{"label":"321Team:test/issue-5-export-fix-positive-20260917","ref":"test/issue-5-export-fix-positive-20260917","sha":"31895081e30e27481e7c17407047c9454e3b247a","user":{"login":"321Team","id":315682664,"node_id":"O_kgDOEtDvaA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/315682664?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/321Team","html_url":"https://github.com/321Team","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/321Team/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/321Team/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/321Team/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/321Team/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.